50
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:15,820
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Thank you, Mr. Chairman, Your Honor, and good afternoon once again.

51
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:22,900
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: On behalf of the Governance Commission for GOCCs or the GCG,

52
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: we express our sincere appreciation

53
00:04:25,940 --> 00:04:29,340
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: for the opportunity to present our accomplishments,

54
00:04:29,340 --> 00:04:34,700
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: ongoing initiatives and budget proposal for fiscal year 2027,

55
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:40,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: as well as our accomplishments and ongoing initiatives

56
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:43,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: that were supported by the previous year's budgets.

57
00:04:43,940 --> 00:04:49,340
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: We hope to show how the reforms implemented in the GOCC sector

58
00:04:49,340 --> 00:04:52,340
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: continue to generate stronger governance,

59
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:54,340
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: better performance,

60
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:55,840
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and greater returns to government.

61
00:04:55,940 --> 00:05:02,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: As well as how our proposed budget will enable us to sustain these gains.

62
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:06,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: As President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr. aptly emphasized,

63
00:05:06,940 --> 00:05:07,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and I quote,

64
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:11,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: we have a duty to uphold the integrity of our institutions

65
00:05:11,940 --> 00:05:15,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: by demanding transparency, accountability,

66
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:19,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and a standard of service worthy of the Filipino people.

67
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:24,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: This principle lies at the very heart of GCG's mandate.

68
00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:27,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The values of transparency, accountability,

69
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:29,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and public service excellence

70
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:32,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: are the standards that guide our oversight

71
00:05:32,940 --> 00:05:35,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: of government-owned or controlled corporations

72
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:40,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and shape the reforms we pursue across the GOCC sector.

73
00:05:41,940 --> 00:05:45,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Before discussing our accomplishments and budget proposal,

74
00:05:45,940 --> 00:05:49,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: allow me to briefly highlight the mandate of the GCG.

75
00:05:49,940 --> 00:05:53,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Our mandate provides the context for the programs and reforms

76
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:57,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: that we implement across the GOCC sector.

77
00:05:57,940 --> 00:06:00,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: It also illustrates how our work in the GCG

78
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:03,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: contributes to good governance,

79
00:06:03,940 --> 00:06:05,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: fiscal responsibility,

80
00:06:05,940 --> 00:06:09,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and improved public service delivery.

81
00:06:09,940 --> 00:06:14,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The GCG was established through Republic Act No. 10149,

82
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:19,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: otherwise known as the GOCC Governance Act of 2011.

83
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:22,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The law was enacted to strengthen oversight

84
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: of GOCCs

85
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:26,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and to ensure that these corporations

86
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:30,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: are managed responsibly, professionally,

87
00:06:30,940 --> 00:06:33,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and in a financially sustainable manner.

88
00:06:35,940 --> 00:06:37,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Through its mandate,

89
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:40,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG serves as the central oversight body

90
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:44,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: that promotes fiscal discipline, accountability,

91
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:47,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: transparency, and sound corporate governance

92
00:06:47,940 --> 00:06:50,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: throughout the GOCC sector,

93
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:53,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: helping translate the President's vision

94
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:57,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: of trustworthy, high-performing public institutions

95
00:06:57,940 --> 00:07:01,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: into concrete outcomes for the Filipino people.

96
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:08,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The GCG performs four core functions.

97
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:11,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: First, we rationalize the sector

98
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:16,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: by determining whether GOCCs continue to serve their intended purpose

99
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:19,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and whether they should be reorganized, merged,

100
00:07:19,940 --> 00:07:22,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: privatized, or abolished.

101
00:07:22,940 --> 00:07:26,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Second, we ensure that qualified and competent individuals

102
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:29,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: serve on GOCC boards.

103
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:34,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Third, we evaluate institutional and individual performance

104
00:07:34,940 --> 00:07:38,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: through standardized performance assessment systems.

105
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:43,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: And fourth, we establish compensation and position classification policies

106
00:07:43,940 --> 00:07:48,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: that promote fairness, competitiveness, and accountability.

107
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:50,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Next slide.

108
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:53,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: As of June 30, 2026,

109
00:07:53,940 --> 00:08:00,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG supervises 112 GOCCs across nine sectors.

110
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:04,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The sectors, Your Honor, are indicated in the slide.

111
00:08:05,940 --> 00:08:10,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The GOCC sector's average corporate governance scorecard rating

112
00:08:10,940 --> 00:08:14,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: improved to 67.14%

113
00:08:15,940 --> 00:08:18,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: above the 61% target

114
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:22,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: for the 2025 Agency Fiscal Targets.

115
00:08:22,940 --> 00:08:28,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: You were able to assess 100% of GOCCs.

116
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:32,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The GCG also completed and submitted

117
00:08:32,940 --> 00:08:37,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the proposed compensation and position classification system

118
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:41,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: to the Office of the President in April 2025,

119
00:08:41,940 --> 00:08:44,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and he approved the CPC-S2

120
00:08:44,940 --> 00:08:47,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: in September of 2026.

121
00:08:48,940 --> 00:08:52,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Next slide, please.

122
00:08:52,940 --> 00:08:53,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: 2025.

123
00:08:53,940 --> 00:08:55,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: I stand corrected, Your Honor.

124
00:08:55,940 --> 00:08:57,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: For the talent pool,

125
00:08:57,940 --> 00:09:02,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG achieved a 38.25%

126
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:05,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: for inclusion in the shortlist of nominees to the President,

127
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:09,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: exceeding the 37% target.

128
00:09:09,940 --> 00:09:11,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: On performance evaluation,

129
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:16,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GOCC sector posted an average score of 75.70%

130
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:17,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: against,

131
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:20,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: against the 78% target,

132
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:24,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: while 100% of qualified GOCC submissions

133
00:09:24,940 --> 00:09:28,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: were subjected to the performance target setting

134
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:31,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: exceeding the 80% target.

135
00:09:33,940 --> 00:09:38,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: For the Agency's 2026 Physical Targets,

136
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:41,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: for 2026,

137
00:09:41,940 --> 00:09:43,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG continues its work

138
00:09:43,940 --> 00:09:46,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: on strengthening the Corporate Governance Scorecard,

139
00:09:46,940 --> 00:09:48,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the CGS.

140
00:09:48,940 --> 00:09:52,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The revised CGS is targeted for issuance this year

141
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:58,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: with the implementation and baseline setting scheduled for 2027.

142
00:09:58,940 --> 00:10:02,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: The assessment of GOCC scorecards is a year-end activity

143
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:06,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: with submissions beginning in October.

144
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:08,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: For CPC-S2,

145
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:13,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the implementation by GOCCs shall commence only upon their completion of

146
00:10:13,940 --> 00:10:15,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and compliance with

147
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:18,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: all required submission requirements.

148
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:22,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: From January 1 to 30 June 2026,

149
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:25,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG has not received any application

150
00:10:25,940 --> 00:10:30,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: for CPC-S2 implementation from any GOCC.

151
00:10:30,940 --> 00:10:33,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Of course, we have reminded them of their obligation

152
00:10:33,940 --> 00:10:36,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: to submit these requirements, Your Honor.

153
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:38,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: As for the talent pool,

154
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:43,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: 21 nominees or 7.55%

155
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:47,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: of 278 qualified candidates

156
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:50,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: had been submitted to the Office of the President

157
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:54,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: against the 38% year-end target.

158
00:10:57,940 --> 00:11:00,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: For the Corporate Governance Scorecard,

159
00:11:00,940 --> 00:11:05,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the validation of the 2025 GOCC Performance Scorecards

160
00:11:05,940 --> 00:11:06,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: is ongoing

161
00:11:06,940 --> 00:11:10,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: with an 80% target for 2026.

162
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:12,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: We have to emphasize, though, Your Honor,

163
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:14,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: that completion depends in part

164
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:18,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: on required supporting reports from the COA and the ARTA.

165
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:21,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: As of June 30 this year,

166
00:11:21,940 --> 00:11:25,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the GCG has received 28 COA-audited financial reports

167
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:30,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and partial customer satisfaction results from the ARTA.

168
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:35,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Performance target setting starts in the third quarter of the year

169
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:37,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: with an 80% target.

170
00:11:37,940 --> 00:11:40,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Evaluation will begin once GOCCs submit

171
00:11:40,940 --> 00:11:44,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the required performance documents.

172
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:46,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Next slide.

173
00:11:46,940 --> 00:11:49,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: From 2023 to 2025,

174
00:11:49,940 --> 00:11:52,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: we see a consistent decline in total subsidies

175
00:11:52,940 --> 00:11:55,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: received by the GOCC sector.

176
00:11:55,940 --> 00:12:00,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: Subsidies went down from 154 billion in 2023

177
00:12:00,940 --> 00:12:04,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: to 128 billion in 2024

178
00:12:04,940 --> 00:12:07,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: and 96 billion in 2025.

179
00:12:07,940 --> 00:12:09,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: This represents a reduction of about

180
00:12:09,940 --> 00:12:12,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: 38% over the past three years.

181
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:15,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: In 2025,

182
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:18,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: the total assets of the GOCC sector

183
00:12:18,940 --> 00:12:23,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: was recorded at 14.38 trillion pesos,

184
00:12:25,940 --> 00:12:27,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: trillion, trillion,

185
00:12:27,940 --> 00:12:29,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: trillion pesos, Your Honor,

186
00:12:29,940 --> 00:12:32,940
GCG Chairperson Atty. Marius P. Corpus: which exhibited an overall increase of 8%

